  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with o→ue stem change in present tense and subjuntivo (except nosotros, which keeps the infinitive stem *aprob-*)",
    "No stem change in preterite, imperfect, future, or conditional",
    "Past participle: *aprobado*",
    "*aprobar un examen* = to pass an exam (*Aprobé el examen por los pelos* — I just barely passed the exam)",
    "*aprobar una ley* = to pass/approve a law",
    "*aprobar algo* = to approve of something (*No apruebo su comportamiento* — I don't approve of his behaviour)",
    "Opposite: *suspender* = to fail (an exam)",
    "Related: *el aprobado* = pass grade; *la aprobación* = approval"
  ],
